graph LR
    A[User opens My Collection] --> B[Grid renders at saved size or Medium default]
    B --> C[User clicks Small grid button]
    C --> D[Grid switches to 8 columns, compact cards]
    D --> E[Name + price only, no set/rarity/quality]
    C --> F[Preference saved to localStorage]
    B --> G[User clicks Large grid button]
    G --> H[Grid switches to 4 columns, full cards]
    H --> I[Full card info: set, rarity, quality, language]
    F --> J[User reloads page]
    J --> K[Grid restores saved size preference]
